Mr Grisenti opined that, in his experience, the breakdown of work required by Part B, [1(f)] of Annexure A to GPN-Costs does not contemplate separating work into phases of the litigation, but rather into (Stanwell Costs Response at [30]; CSE Costs Response at [29]):
types of work such as:
a. Attendances;
b. Research;
c. Drafting correspondence;
d. Reading correspondence;
e. Drafting documents;
f. Reading documents;
g. Attending trial; and
h. Clerical attendances.
